    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d52">

                <pb facs="0148" n="142" xml:id="pg142"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. McCook to Mr.
                            Seward.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 32.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Honolulu</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1867-08-05"><hi rendition="#italic">August 5,
                        1867</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose yon the copy of
                    a communication addressed by me to Gen. Yan Valkenburgh, United States minister
                    resident at Yedo, Japan.</p>
                <p>The note explains itself; and as I deemed it essential to the interests of the
                    public service that it should be written and forwarded promptly, I hope its
                    contents will meet with your entire approval.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Edward M. McCook.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d52-a1.xml" xpointer="d52-a1"/>
            </div>
